  "supplyGroupHelper": "Food and water only. Without one, the item counts towards no group.",
  "supplyGroupsUnassignedTitle": "Without a group",
  "supplyGroupsUnassignedBody": "These items count nowhere above. The app does not assign them itself — \"pasta bake seasoning\" is not grain, and guessing here would be wrong once too often.",
  "supplyGroupsUnmeasuredTitle": "Group yes, amount no",
  "supplyGroupsUnmeasuredBody": "These have a group, but their unit cannot be reduced to grams or millilitres — or it does not match the group. They are missing from the figures above too.",
  "supplyGroupsAllAssigned": "Every food and water item is in a group.",
  "supplyGroupsSource": "Source: the stockpiling calculator of the German Federal Office for Agriculture and Food (BLE), amounts per person and day at 2200 kcal.",
