  "firstAidContentVersionTitle": "Where these guides come from",
  "firstAidContentVersionBody": "Content follows the 2025 Guidelines of the European Resuscitation Council. The pages under \"Mental distress\" follow the IFRC International first aid, resuscitation and education guidelines 2025. What a first aid course teaches is agreed jointly by the aid organisations; in a course, what is said there applies.",
