  "firstAidVideoPackWhereTitle": "Where to get one",
  "firstAidVideoPackWhereBody": "There are no ready-made packs, and this app points at none. Every usable German first aid video is somebody’s copyright — the aid organisations’ material entirely. Freely licensed material exists mainly on Wikimedia Commons, but little of it: on 22 September 2026 the category “Videos of cardiopulmonary resuscitation” held eight files, mostly not in German, one of them a dog being resuscitated. Each licence is on its own file page and has to be checked one by one.",
